---
description: Project-wide assistant rules
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- Always respond in English.
- Never hardcode user-facing strings.
- Any text visible to users must come from i18n keys in JSON locale files.
- Keep wording consistent with the existing app style.
- For frontend translation changes, always update both:
  - `front/src/locales/en/*.json`
  - `front/src/locales/es/*.json`
- For backend translation changes, always update both:
  - `back/src/locales/en/**/*.json`
  - `back/src/locales/es/**/*.json`
- Use `yarn` for scripts and package commands.
